Installing it
-------------
    curl -fsSL -o js-debug.tar.gz \
      https://github.com/microsoft/vscode-js-debug/releases/download/v1.117.0/js-debug-dap-v1.117.0.tar.gz
    mkdir -p ~/.local/share/js-debug
    tar -xzf js-debug.tar.gz -C ~/.local/share/js-debug
